==Description==
The '''Epheremus Drifter''' is a gear item that goes in the torso slot. This is the same slot that the [[Glider]] and [[Immobilator]] use so a player cannot have more than one of those gear items equipped. The drifter is an "inertia pack". When activated (default {{Key|space}}), character's velocity (speed and direction) at that moment is preserved. The character continues with that velocity for a short time, until the drifter charge runs out, or the pack is deactivated with {{Key|space}}. Once used, the drifter must remain unused for a '''very''' short time allowing it to charge up again. Like other gear items, it has a durability and will break after being used for a while.
